# Hosts that cannot play video in the bundled engine.
#
# The engine ships no media pipeline and no codecs, so <video> and <audio>
# render as empty boxes on these sites. When "Media fallback" is enabled the
# browser hands them to the platform's own webview instead, which already exists
# for DRM and already works.
#
# One host per line. '#' starts a comment. A leading "*." is accepted but
# stripped, so store bare hosts. Suffix matching is on a label boundary, meaning
# "youtube.com" also covers www., m. and music. subdomains.

youtube.com
youtu.be
vimeo.com
dailymotion.com
twitch.tv
netflix.com
hulu.com
disneyplus.com
primevideo.com
peacocktv.com
paramountplus.com
max.com
crunchyroll.com
bilibili.com
nicovideo.jp
youku.com
iqiyi.com
